Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:06.172
[footsteps]

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.641 align:start size:63% position:38% line:0%
Hey, how's it going?

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:09.709
Hey!

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:14.581 align:start size:75% position:25%
