00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:17.417 align:end size:91% position:91%
Wait, what is
Yale Club Jump Rope?

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:21.087
Hold on you're telling me you've
never heard of Club Jump Rope!?

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.122 size:84% position:58%
No?

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, fair enough.
We're pretty new.

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:28.862
We’re Yale’s newest club sport.
We do performances, competitions

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.031 align:start position:0%
It's a good workout,
but mostly

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:33.666
it’s just a fun group of people
to hang out with.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:36.302
You know, this sounds like
something I'd be interested in.

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:37.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, awesome!

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:40.707
[upbeat saxophone music]

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:41.941
I'll warn you though,

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.411
I haven't done this
since elementary school.

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:46.379
♪

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:48.882 align:end size:97% position:97% line:91%
That's totally fine,
we'll teach you everything!

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:51.718 align:start size:88% position:13% line:71%
But...

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:51.718 align:end size:88% position:88% line:91%
Don’t worry about it,
just follow along!

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:52.819
[group claps]
clap clap

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.687
♪ Let’s celebrate ♪

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.890
♪ Dance to the beat ♪

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.958
♪ Forget the woes ♪

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.061
